[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0010","text":"……以上就是活动当天的流程\n大家有什么问题吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0020","text":"没问题──！／没问题"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0030","text":"路加她——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0040","text":"……不走了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0050","text":"好，知道了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0060","text":"活动上会有很多其他艺人出演，\n非演出时间希望大家好好享受"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0070","text":"说不定能受到一些好的影响呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0080","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_9999","text":"活动资料"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0090","text":"『出演者────\n　──、──、Me Me Maiden』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0100","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0110","text":"這次活動，\n最關鍵的就是新曲的首次現場演出"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0120","text":"──畢竟最近大家都各自忙著個人活動"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0130","text":"趁這個機會，\n讓我們辦一場能展現CoMETIK作為團體實力的舞台吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0140","text":"好──！／好……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0150","text":"喂────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0160","text":"哦，怎麼了路加\n有問題嗎？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0170","text":"這個活動────\n結束之後我馬上就走"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0180","text":"還有，後台誰都不准進來"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0190","text":"啊，好，我知道了\n我會安排好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01080200_07_0200","text":"（……難道演出者裡，\n　有她不想見到的人嗎……？）"}]
